{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "18a4402e-c460-802c-9edf-efaf5266aa02",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T10:48:15-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nilson Pina",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:45:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, how can I help you this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:45:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi, you got me on speaker, I'm, uh, hold on, I'm moving boxes here. Nilson Pina, 18 Howard Street, Fifth Ward. My basement took water Friday night into Saturday, with that storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:45:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Pina, sorry to hear that. How did it come in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:46:01-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The window well, the glass on the street side, and the basement windows. Water just sitting against the house. About two inches on the floor. I got file boxes, paperwork, all soaked. My workbench, hand tools, everything I got down there, I'm drying screwdrivers on a towel like an idiot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:46:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a lot of mess. Is the water coming from the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:46:22-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the whole thing. The whole block drains down to the corner, right, and the grate there, it's plugged. You can see it. Leaves, sand, I don't know what. It's been looking like that for months and nobody ever comes and touches it. Thirty-eight years I'm in this house. You'd think somebody would [inaudible] the thing before a storm, not after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:46:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you cut out. Somebody would what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:46:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Clean it! Before a storm. That's all I'm asking. Instead the street fills up and it goes right in my windows."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:46:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Which corner is the grate on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:46:54-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The corner at the end of my block, right down from eighteen. You can't miss it, it's the one with the gunk on top. And who even owns that, is that you guys or the state? Because I don't want to get bounced around to five different numbers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:47:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Howard Street's a city street, so that catch basin is ours. You called the right place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:47:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. Then somebody gotta come, because it's gonna rain again and I'm, wait. [pause] Hold on. I walked in the kitchen for something and now I got no idea what. Unbelievable. Sorry. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:47:26-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happens to all of us. I'm logging this as a drain backup at the corner by 18 Howard, with the water getting into your basement. I've got a crew going out to check that corner tomorrow, Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:47:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow. Okay. They're actually gonna come tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:47:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's on tomorrow's list. Is there a good number if they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:47:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one three one. It's my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:47:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one three one. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:47:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I just, I don't want to be calling again next storm saying the same thing, you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:48:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. It's written down, and the crew will see the history on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:48:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks, Denise. Now I gotta go figure out what I came in here for."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:48:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good luck with the drying, Mr. Pina. Take care."
    }
  ],
